        "type": "text",
        "text": "<i>Exserohilum</i> <i>turcicum</i> is a fungal pathogen. The growth of the mycelium of the fungus damages the leaves of maize plants, <i>Zea</i> <i>mays</i>. Leaf damage reduces crop yield.",
